coveragereport/
coverage.*/
**/coverage.*.xml
**/coverage.*.cobertura.xml
**/coverage.*.opencover.xml
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.cobertura.xml
*.opencover.xml
StrykerOutput/
dotCover/
OpenCover/

